<title>USA: Chromatics extends expiry of warrants.</title>
<headline>Chromatics extends expiry of warrants.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chromatics Color Sciences International Inc said Wednesday its board has extended the expiration date of outstanding common stock purchase warrants to November 5 from August 5.</p>
<p>The company said the warrants include up to 1.15 million warrants issued as part of its initial public offering in February 1993, up to 240,000 warrants issued in a private placement before the IPO and up to 115,000 warrants issued to Investors Associates Inc.</p>
</text>
